WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.263
Three takeaways.

00:00:01.263 --> 00:00:07.812
Heat is not temperature; internal energy is particle kinetic plus potential energy.

00:00:07.812 --> 00:00:14.046
Three modes: conduction, convection, radiation — and radiation works in vacuum.

00:00:14.046 --> 00:00:18.308
Vacuum flask: vacuum, silvering, stopper, narrow neck.

00:00:18.308 --> 00:00:19.728
Lesson Two — done!
